#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2253 expect=skipped domain=TT
#note "NEITHER column is declared, so the All leg is unmet and the parent skips - unchanged in verdict from the Any gate, but the state is no longer silent: the dataset sister FDA-SD9730 (Sensitivity Dataset) reports the absent pair once. The old DIRECTION-PIN reasoning written for the Any leg is retired with the wave E Any -> All rewrite; the direction is now pinned by the four-state set (parent + two R-5.25 siblings + sister), whose scenarios each name the member owning the neighbouring state."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation
